  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "87E3670EF89B19FA",
      "text": "Wie geht’s, wie steht’s? Dann wollen wir mal\\nmit dem Unterricht anfangen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "87E3660EF89B1847",
      "text": "Bei der Zwischenprüfung habt ihr alle sehr gut\\nabgeschnitten![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "87E3650EF89B1694",
      "text": "Ich danke euch auch für eure Antworten auf die\\nZusatzfrage. Sie werden mir bei meiner weiteren\\r\\nArbeit am Pokédex bestimmt hilfreich sein.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "87E3640EF89B14E1",
      "text": "So! Heute beginnt also die zweite Hälfte des\\nSemesters.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "87E3630EF89B132E",
      "text": "Es ist wichtig, dass wir unser Wissen erweitern\\nund uns weiterentwickeln - wie Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "87E3620EF89B117B",
      "text": "Und da haben wir auch schon das Stichwort zur\\nheutigen Lektion: entwickeln![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "87E3610EF89B0FC8",
      "text": "Heute lernen wir mehr über die Entwicklung\\nvon Pokémon.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "87E3600EF89B0E15",
      "text": "Kämpfe lassen Pokémon im Level aufsteigen,\\nwodurch sie neue Attacken erlernen und stärker\\r\\nwerden.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "87E35F0EF89B0C62",
      "text": "Das ist aber noch nicht alles! Wenn manche\\nPokémon einen bestimmten Level erreichen...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "87DFE20EF8980224",
      "text": "...ändert sich ihre Gestalt und ihre Statuswerte\\nwerden stark erhöht.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "87DFE30EF89803D7",
      "text": "Dieses Phänomen nennen wir Entwicklung![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "87DFE40EF898058A",
      "text": "Wenn Pokémon sich entwickeln, werden sie viel\\nstärker. Das macht sie im Kampf zu verlässlichen\\r\\nPartnern![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "87DFE50EF898073D",
      "text": "Manche Trainer bevorzugen es allerdings,\\ndie Entwicklung ihres Pokémon abzubrechen,\\r\\nweil sie es süß finden, so wie es ist.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "87DFDE0EF897FB58",
      "text": "Dazu muss man nur einen Knopf drücken, sobald\\ndas Pokémon die Entwicklung beginnt.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "87DFDF0EF897FD0B",
      "text": "Dann lasst uns mal alle laut im Chor sagen,\\nwelcher Knopf das ist! Drei, zwei, eins und...![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_a_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "B9D7A97DF6F13C16",
      "text": "Der A-Knopf!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_a_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "B9D7A87DF6F13A63",
      "text": "Der B-Knopf!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_a_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "B9D7A77DF6F138B0",
      "text": "Der C-Knopf!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_a_05_ecology_answer_01",
      "hash64": "59FAA449A854AA93",
      "text": "Oje, du hast als [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0708,0000)]EinzigerEinzige eine falsche Antwort\\ngegeben, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\c\\nDer A-Knopf wird eher für Bestätigungen genutzt.\\n„A-lles paletti“ sozusagen, hehe![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
